.
.  Generate a conditioning plot
.
device 1 x11
set ipl1na condpl.ps
pre-erase off
erase
device 2 postscript
device 1 font simplex
.
skip 1
read pr1.dat time temp torque y
skip 0
.
label case asis
multiplot 2 3
multiplot corner coordinates 8 8 92 92
multiplot scale factor 2
label size 3
tic label size 3
title size 3
char size 2
.
char fill on
char circle 
lines blank
.
x1label Time (minutes)
x1label displacement 12
y1label Torque
ylabel displacement 12
ylimits 5 8
major ytic mark number 4
minor ytic mark number 1
xlimits 0 150
major xtic mark number 4
minor xtic mark number 1
tic offset units data
xtic offset 5 0
ytic offset 0.2 0.5
.
set condition plot frame default
condition plot torque time temp
.
. box 0 0 100 100
.
device 2 close
system mv CONDPL.PS condpl.ps
quit
